pps/3702120/extras/6b1a50131de1aa9abb15051ce031ca35.webm?t=1768388590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/6b1a50131de1aa9abb15051ce031ca35.mp4?t=1768388590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT LIES BENEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the lights flicker and the mind falters. You can hide, run, or descend into the heart of the dark\u2026 but nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ca1cfec1c6061298754c0bcc005d5275.poster.avif?t=1768388590\" width=780 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ca1cfec1c6061298754c0bcc005d5275.webm?t=1768388590\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/extras/ca1cfec1c6061298754c0bcc005d5275.mp4?t=1768388590\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the light lies calm, in the dark lies paranoia\u2026 <strong>Life &amp; Shadow: Celestial Call</strong> delivers a psychological horror experience that seeps into the subconscious, where tension steadily rises with every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic day/night cycle</strong>: daylight tasks and resource management turn into nighttime basement exploration and tense puzzle-solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the fractured story through <strong>telescope observations, cryptic symbols, and forgotten notes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light crafting and resource management</strong>: keep the observatory powered, maintain the systems, and survive the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric sound design and environmental storytelling</strong> constantly challenge your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings shaped by your choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life &amp; Shadow: Celestial Call</strong> is an unforgettable experience where serenity meets dread, and science unravels into madness. Even silence carries a voice\u2026 and the journey will echo in your mind long after it ends.</p>","developers":["Immeta  Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702120/38b4fd58ef00c5aec0ff7c84e818be704248fcfe/header.jpg?t=1768388590","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>\u00a9 2025 Immeta Studios. All rights reserved.</strong><br><strong>Life & Shadow: Celestial Call </strong>and all associated logos, characters, and design elements are trademarks or registered trademarks of Immeta Studios.<br>Unauthorized reproduction or distribution of this game or any portion of it may result in civil and criminal penalties.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702120/1292010491/cfd0ac22d16246c85736e871b389d2802bb91580/1759751808/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759754843","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702120/1292010491/cfd0ac22d16246c85736e871b389d2802bb91580/1759751808/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759754843","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3702120/1292010491/cfd0ac22d16246c85736e871b389d2802bb91580/1759751808/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759754843","id":257184858,"name":"Life and Shadow: Celestial Call Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184858/fdc5f7618d85825e00d0cc0f7c18040b4ae9ab86